  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Global Water Security and Sanitation Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GWSP is a multi-donor trust fund established by the World Bank&#x2019;s Water Global Practice in 2017 to lead its analytic and policy-related work on WASH and water security, informing the Bank&#x2019;s lending programmes and the global water sector. GWSP has secured a good reputation for its analytic work and the technical assistance it provides government partners to improve the design and performance of the World Bank&#x2019;s portfolio of programmes covering water security, sanitation and hygiene.         
       
Our support to GWSP will inform, reinforce and extend our work on WASH systems strengthening and sector finance. It will also make a significant contribution to the UK&#x2019;s commitment to ending the preventable deaths of mothers, babies and young children.</narrative>
  </description>
